If anything goes wrong,

290
00:18:07,400 --> 00:18:09,799
you'll never work in this industry again.

291
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:12,240
You know what to do.

292
00:18:19,319 --> 00:18:20,599
That would mean disqualification.

293
00:18:20,599 --> 00:18:21,599
Exactly.

294
00:18:31,079 --> 00:18:32,640
I thought my skills were inferior,

295
00:18:32,640 --> 00:18:34,000
so I chose to swap the wine.

296
00:18:34,359 --> 00:18:35,839
The honor that truly belonged to me,

297
00:18:35,839 --> 00:18:36,920
I couldn't get.

298
00:18:36,920 --> 00:18:38,839
But what I tried so hard to swap for

299
00:18:38,839 --> 00:18:40,200
just got me disqualified.

300
00:18:43,160 --> 00:18:44,000
What a joke.

301
00:18:44,920 --> 00:18:46,880
This has always been a joke.

302
00:19:25,240 --> 00:19:26,200
I told you

303
00:19:26,759 --> 00:19:28,799
I'd let you drink this wine sooner or later.

304
00:19:33,200 --> 00:19:34,240
I just realized

305
00:19:35,279 --> 00:19:36,920
how beautiful the night view is from here.

306
00:19:38,839 --> 00:19:40,200
You know...

307
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:43,880
I really envy Ye Xiaowei.

308
00:19:46,279 --> 00:19:47,880
We have similar backgrounds.

309
00:19:49,640 --> 00:19:50,759
She can calmly face

310
00:19:50,759 --> 00:19:52,400
her unbearable past,

311
00:19:54,519 --> 00:19:56,240
and still get Cheng An's love.

312
00:19:58,799 --> 00:20:01,000
She has everything I've ever dreamed of.

313
00:20:02,359 --> 00:20:03,640
But I...

314
00:20:04,039 --> 00:20:05,559
have always struggled between power

315
00:20:06,039 --> 00:20:07,759
and love.

316
00:20:09,240 --> 00:20:11,359
I could never follow my own heart.

317
00:20:12,000 --> 00:20:13,960
If you could live your life over again,

318
00:20:14,720 --> 00:20:16,079
would you still make the same choices?

319
00:20:19,440 --> 00:20:21,240
Envying Ye Xiaowei is one thing,

320
00:20:23,200 --> 00:20:24,640
but I am still me.

321
00:20:30,119 --> 00:20:32,079
Once certain choices are made,

322
00:20:32,880 --> 00:20:34,160
there's no turning back.

323
00:20:34,599 --> 00:20:35,880
Have you ever regretted it?

324
00:20:36,880 --> 00:20:38,519
So many people got hurt because of you.

325
00:20:38,599 --> 00:20:39,680
Died because of you.

326
00:20:40,759 --> 00:20:41,559
From me,

327
00:20:42,480 --> 00:20:43,519
to Chu Yan,

328
00:20:43,720 --> 00:20:45,359
Zhao Yue, and even Wan Niang.

329
00:20:45,799 --> 00:20:47,279
You've ruined so many lives.

330
00:20:48,480 --> 00:20:50,680
Did you ever feel guilt late at night?

331
00:20:50,960 --> 00:20:52,279
Or regret?

332
00:20:59,640 --> 00:21:00,920
Once a move is made,

333
00:21:01,279 --> 00:21:02,599
No regrets.

334
00:21:03,799 --> 00:21:05,039
As for my life,

335
00:21:06,640 --> 00:21:08,519
I never look back.

336
00:21:10,480 --> 00:21:11,480
That's very Lin Wanmei of you.

337
00:21:13,160 --> 00:21:13,960
Good.

338
00:21:16,200 --> 00:21:18,480
Actually, I've learned a lot from you too.

339
00:21:19,279 --> 00:21:20,480
I used to think

340
00:21:22,400 --> 00:21:24,039
good people don't always get rewarded,

341
00:21:24,680 --> 00:21:25,960
and that kindness isn't worth it.

342
00:21:27,000 --> 00:21:28,240
That only bad

343
00:21:28,839 --> 00:21:30,119
and selfish people

344
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:32,200
can live a good life.

345
00:21:33,279 --> 00:21:34,319
But right now,

346
00:21:34,319 --> 00:21:36,279
I realize more clearly than ever

347
00:21:36,880 --> 00:21:37,720
that the kind of life

348
00:21:37,720 --> 00:21:39,519
anyone wants to live

349
00:21:40,119 --> 00:21:41,359
has nothing to do with their background.

350
00:21:43,359 --> 00:21:45,480
It's about every choice you make.

351
00:21:47,440 --> 00:21:48,240
Lin Wanmei,

352
00:21:48,839 --> 00:21:50,160
since we were once Master and apprentice,

353
00:21:55,759 --> 00:21:57,720
I hope you get to live the life you want.

354
00:22:01,960 --> 00:22:02,759
Ye Xiaowei,

355
00:22:10,640 --> 00:22:11,599
let's say our goodbyes.

356
00:22:36,240 --> 00:22:37,039
Wanmei

357
00:22:50,599 --> 00:22:51,400
Let's go.

358
00:23:01,440 --> 00:23:02,240
Are you okay?

359
00:23:02,559 --> 00:23:03,359
I'm fine.

360
00:23:10,200 --> 00:23:11,000
Let's go.

361
00:23:17,599 --> 00:23:18,799
Why are you up here on the roof?

362
00:23:21,720 --> 00:23:22,960
Stay and talk to me.

363
00:23:23,920 --> 00:23:24,720
Okay.

364
00:23:32,559 --> 00:23:33,400
I don't think I've ever

365
00:23:33,400 --> 00:23:35,279
told you about my childhood.

366
00:23:38,640 --> 00:23:39,960
I was born in

367
00:23:40,839 --> 00:23:42,920
Taojia Village, surrounded by grapes.

368
00:23:43,920 --> 00:23:45,519
The hills and fields there

369
00:23:45,519 --> 00:23:46,799
were covered in grapes.

370
00:23:47,759 --> 00:23:49,400
Every day, I'd open my eyes,

371
00:23:50,240 --> 00:23:51,720
only to pick grapes,

372
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:52,960
plant grapes,

373
00:23:54,000 --> 00:23:54,799
prune branches,

374
00:23:55,759 --> 00:23:56,559
till the soil,

375
00:23:57,119 --> 00:23:57,920
and fertilize.

376
00:23:59,240 --> 00:24:00,359
All year round,

377
00:24:01,440 --> 00:24:02,559
day after day.

378
00:24:03,160 --> 00:24:04,079
But do you know

379
00:24:06,880 --> 00:24:08,279
why I refuse to admit

380
00:24:08,279 --> 00:24:10,119
that I'm a fruit farmer's daughter?

381
00:24:11,880 --> 00:24:13,759
You think I'm afraid of that?

382
00:24:14,559 --> 00:24:15,519
It's because I hate it.

383
00:24:17,000 --> 00:24:18,960
I hate the poverty there,

384
00:24:19,359 --> 00:24:20,119
the backwardness,

385
00:24:20,599 --> 00:24:21,319
the foolishness,

386
00:24:21,319 --> 00:24:22,039
the ignorance.

387
00:24:23,200 --> 00:24:25,519
I hate parents who don't raise kids.

388
00:24:26,200 --> 00:24:28,319
Girls like us who were born there

389
00:24:29,160 --> 00:24:30,480
were nothing but toys

390
00:24:30,480 --> 00:24:32,880
for those men to grope and abuse.

391
00:24:33,559 --> 00:24:34,799
I had no choice.

392
00:24:35,559 --> 00:24:36,720
I could only escape.

393
00:24:38,599 --> 00:24:40,559
I thought as long as I got out,

394
00:24:41,000 --> 00:24:42,480
as long as I was ruthless,

395
00:24:42,559 --> 00:24:44,599
pushed hard, and risked everything,

396
00:24:46,839 --> 00:24:49,920
I could make a name for myself.

397
00:24:56,599 --> 00:24:57,400
Finally,

398
00:25:01,079 --> 00:25:02,640
everything is coming to an end.

399
00:25:07,240 --> 00:25:08,039
Wanmei,

400
00:25:08,200 --> 00:25:09,279
let's go back down first.

401
00:25:09,759 --> 00:25:10,559
Zhou Yucheng,

402
00:25:13,680 --> 00:25:14,920
thank you for loving me.

403
00:25:16,880 --> 00:25:17,720
I know

404
00:25:19,759 --> 00:25:21,519
that only you truly love me.

405
00:25:31,359 --> 00:25:32,559
Have a drink with me.

406
00:25:33,920 --> 00:25:34,759
Okay.

407
00:25:53,359 --> 00:25:54,160
Wanmei

408
00:26:29,079 --> 00:26:29,880
Wanmei

409
00:26:32,279 --> 00:26:34,240
You've always focused solely on fame and wealth.

410
00:26:35,079 --> 00:26:37,279
Love was never something you considered.

411
00:26:39,359 --> 00:26:40,359
In their eyes,

412
00:26:41,079 --> 00:26:42,000
you're hypocritical,

413
00:26:42,319 --> 00:26:43,119
frivolous,

414
00:26:43,359 --> 00:26:44,160
and vicious.

415
00:26:47,519 --> 00:26:48,720
But in my eyes,

416
00:26:50,440 --> 00:26:51,880
you are my love.

417
00:26:53,400 --> 00:26:54,599
Wherever you stand,

418
00:26:55,200 --> 00:26:56,680
is love itself.

419
00:26:57,599 --> 00:26:58,440
I love you.

420
00:27:00,160 --> 00:27:01,720
I love your kindness and hypocrisy.

421
00:27:02,519 --> 00:27:03,440
I love your radiance

422
00:27:03,960 --> 00:27:04,759
and ruthlessness.

423
00:27:05,599 --> 00:27:07,240
I love all your strengths

424
00:27:07,480 --> 00:27:08,440
and flaws even more.

425
00:27:13,200 --> 00:27:15,720
Actually, Lin Wanmei had a pitiful life.

426
00:27:18,279 --> 00:27:20,160
Though she pushed me into the abyss,

427
00:27:21,799 --> 00:27:23,680
she also taught me how to make wine.

428
00:27:25,160 --> 00:27:27,160
So today, regardless of right or wrong,

429
00:27:29,119 --> 00:27:30,559
I came to see her off.

430
00:27:32,160 --> 00:27:33,359
If she could have realized

431
00:27:34,400 --> 00:27:35,640
that there are things in this world

432
00:27:35,640 --> 00:27:36,799
far more precious than fame and wealth,

433
00:27:37,839 --> 00:27:39,440
her ending might not have been like this.

434
00:27:41,240 --> 00:27:42,039
Let's go.

435
00:27:58,279 --> 00:27:59,079
Wanmei

436
00:27:59,319 --> 00:28:01,319
I'm going to turn myself in.

437
00:28:01,759 --> 00:28:03,759
I've done so many terrible things.

438
00:28:04,200 --> 00:28:06,200
I should face justice.

439
00:28:13,200 --> 00:28:15,200
Your bag doesn't have a zipper.

440
00:28:15,599 --> 00:28:17,599
It's not safe to keep your ID in there.

441
00:28:19,559 --> 00:28:20,440
Then where should I put it?

442
00:28:23,440 --> 00:28:24,400
Tell you what,

443
00:28:25,319 --> 00:28:26,160
let me hold onto it.

444
00:28:29,920 --> 00:28:30,759
Here.

445
00:28:39,880 --> 00:28:40,359
Give it here.

446
00:28:52,640 --> 00:28:53,480
Smile.

447
00:28:54,480 --> 00:28:55,319
Look at the camera.

448
00:29:09,839 --> 00:29:10,680
OK

449
00:29:30,200 --> 00:29:31,039
Mrs. Cheng.

450
00:29:32,039 --> 00:29:32,880
Hurry up and give me a like.

451
00:29:37,440 --> 00:29:38,680
Do I really have to remind you?

452
00:29:46,880 --> 00:29:49,119
You don't usually post anything anyway.

453
00:29:50,279 --> 00:29:52,680
But seeing you post today,

454
00:29:53,440 --> 00:29:54,440
you seemed pretty experienced.

455
00:29:55,039 --> 00:29:56,319
How long did you practice in secret?

456
00:29:57,480 --> 00:29:58,319
Wanna know?

457
00:29:59,960 --> 00:30:00,799
Come here.

458
00:30:03,440 --> 00:30:04,279
I'm not telling you.

459
00:30:06,240 --> 00:30:07,240
Childish.

460
00:30:08,880 --> 00:30:10,039
Are you getting tired of me already?

461
00:30:10,400 --> 00:30:11,680
Let me tell you, it's too late.

462
00:30:11,680 --> 00:30:13,440
We already got our marriage certificate.

463
00:30:14,240 --> 00:30:15,759
Bound together for life.

464
00:30:15,759 --> 00:30:16,400
You know?

465
00:30:16,599 --> 00:30:17,319
Who says?

466
00:30:17,720 --> 00:30:18,200
Let me go.

467
00:30:18,519 --> 00:30:18,920
I won't.

468
00:30:18,920 --> 00:30:19,359
Let go.

469
00:30:19,359 --> 00:30:20,079
No.

470
00:30:20,960 --> 00:30:21,480
Let go.

471
00:30:28,240 --> 00:30:28,640
Xiaowei.

472
00:30:30,480 --> 00:30:30,880
I love you.

473
00:30:39,559 --> 00:30:39,960
What?

474
00:30:40,640 --> 00:30:41,720
I didn't hear you.

475
00:30:43,440 --> 00:30:44,759
I said, I love you.

476
00:31:03,000 --> 00:31:03,960
Welcome.

477
00:31:04,359 --> 00:31:06,079
Welcome to the Roses for An

478
00:31:06,079 --> 00:31:06,640
launch event.

479
00:31:06,640 --> 00:31:07,160
Welcome.

480
00:31:07,160 --> 00:31:08,920
Congratulations. Congratulations.

481
00:31:09,440 --> 00:31:10,480
Stand up straight.

482
00:31:10,480 --> 00:31:11,279
Yes, honey.

483
00:31:17,039 --> 00:31:17,599
Have a taste.

484
00:31:19,359 --> 00:31:20,519
Everyone, please try the wine.

485
00:31:22,359 --> 00:31:23,000
Here you go.

486
00:31:24,839 --> 00:31:26,240
Congratulations on your new journey.

487
00:31:26,400 --> 00:31:28,599
What made you decide

488
00:31:28,599 --> 00:31:30,480
to create this independent wine brand?

489
00:31:30,720 --> 00:31:32,200
Like many people,

490
00:31:32,519 --> 00:31:33,640
I come from a humble background

491
00:31:33,720 --> 00:31:35,599
and have endured life's hardships.

492
00:31:36,359 --> 00:31:37,720
But I've always believed

493
00:31:38,240 --> 00:31:39,759
that as long as you have a dream,

494
00:31:40,079 --> 00:31:41,359
every effort will bear fruit.

495
00:31:42,680 --> 00:31:43,440
So,

496
00:31:43,440 --> 00:31:44,960
for this wine brand of mine,

497
00:31:45,319 --> 00:31:46,640
I hope it's not just

498
00:31:46,640 --> 00:31:48,480
bottles of high-quality wine,

499
00:31:48,720 --> 00:31:50,000
but a symbol

500
00:31:50,599 --> 00:31:51,839
carrying dreams,

501
00:31:52,359 --> 00:31:53,359
hope,

502
00:31:53,440 --> 00:31:54,319
and courage.

503
00:31:54,480 --> 00:31:56,160
May everyone who tastes it

504
00:31:56,160 --> 00:31:58,160
feel the aftertaste of life,

505
00:31:58,680 --> 00:32:00,279
and be able to find

506
00:32:00,960 --> 00:32:02,480
their way forward in adversity.

507
00:32:12,759 --> 00:32:13,559
Finally,

508
00:32:13,920 --> 00:32:16,759
I hope that in your everyday lives,

509
00:32:16,759 --> 00:32:18,599
you can all find your own happiness.

510
00:32:19,000 --> 00:32:19,640
Cheers!

511
00:32:19,839 --> 00:32:21,680
Cheers! Cheers!
